You will join our engineering team and become a valued member, working closely in a collaborative, autonomous, and cross-functional team. You will help with the following:
Build and develop scalable web applications and pages using React and Node.js;
Develop solutions that support Organic Search, Growth and GEO initiatives across thousands of web pages;
Work on page architecture, content scaling and structured data implementations;
Maintain, improve and troubleshoot existing web applications and websites;
Collaborate closely with engineering, Growth, SEO and other stakeholders to understand requirements and translate them into technical solutions;
Contribute to initiatives aimed at improving visibility across traditional search engines and AI-driven search platforms;
Work with Content Management Systems and content-driven web experiences;
Develop and consume APIs and integrate services where required;
Test solutions across different browsers and devices and identify technical issues;
Use Git-based source control and modern development workflows;
Contribute ideas for improving applications, development processes and the way the team delivers solutions at scale;
Participate in Agile ceremonies, technical discussions and project planning;
Take ownership of assigned tasks and deliver high-quality solutions within agreed timelines.

Bachelor's degree in Computer Science or any related technical field.
